WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.800
Black Ledger Network. Turn 0 -> Turn 1 for Emerald
Sprawl: First Pressure.

2
00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:05.600
Turn 0 was operator setup, hidden clocks, and seeded
faction posture. Turn 1 is the first public city
reaction that players can inspect without touching
private table state. Turn 1 — The city is moving.

3
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:08.400
Black Ledger Network: The anchor desk opens on a city
already in motion, not a brochure intro or a static
explainer card.

4
00:00:08.400 --> 00:00:11.200
Rust Market runners: Old favors came due around a
failed gear reconciliation and shoved Debt Heat to the
front of the board.

5
00:00:11.200 --> 00:00:14.000
rust market syndicate: Old favors were called in after
a failed gear reconciliation.

6
00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:16.800
ashline circle: Awakened build demand increased after
a visible source-clarity dispute.

7
00:00:16.800 --> 00:00:19.600
Rust Bazaar is the hottest visible district at 77
heat. Rust Bazaar moved the hardest this turn with
delta 8.

8
00:00:19.600 --> 00:00:20.900
Receipt-backed and public-safe.
